      "content": "company name is not changed, it complains \"name already exists\" after I renamed a previous created company.\nAdd the company name to the company's home view. The left bar must be collapsible/expandable and show company name as well in the top.\nWe must be able to add company's logo.\n\nNew company must run the company's wizard.\n\n---\n\nTask mode: complete this end to end without asking questions or offering options. Use the tools, implement and validate the result, and finish with a final report (What happened, What I did, Demo, Next tasks). Only stop for a hard blocker that makes the task impossible.",
