92 after creation the wizard opens on that company.\n6. `docker exec codx-junior-api /home/codx-junior/codx-junior/api/.venv/bin/python -m pytest /home/codx-junior/codx-junior/api/tests/test_company_naming.py -q`\n\nI'll keep it tight.",
