ogo, a company logo, or an abstract design, but it appears to be a large purple shape with dark surrounding elements. There are faint, indistinct smudges in the background white area that might be wr\u2026\n\n> Candidate collection was bounded (per-module/scan cap). The list above is a ranked sample, not every hit: narrow `modules` or make the query more specific to see more.\n> Skipped 2 file(s) larger than 8.0 MB.",
