      "timestamp": "2026-11-22T19:49:57.286143+00:00",
      "summary": "1. **Request:** fix company identity handling in `codx-junior-platform` \u2014 renames, slugs, logos and the per-company shell.\n2. **Backend:** `company/manager.py` \u2014 `_unique_slug()` (`acme`, `acme-2`), 409 only for explicitly requested slugs, slug re-derived on rename, `_clean_logo()` accepts `\"\"`/`http(s)://`/`data:image/\u2026base64` \u2264 1 MB.\n3. **Frontend:** `store/company.js` refreshes the summary list; `CompanyView.vue` renders the logo as `<img>` (sidebar + mobile drawer) and runs the wizard for the new company; `CompanyHome.vue` got an identity header; `CompanySettings.vue` gained logo preview/Upload/Remove and follows the new slug after a rename; `CompanyWizard.vue` accepts `companyId`.\n4. **Validation:** `api/tests/test_company_naming.py` \u2014 12 new tests, **26 passed** with the existing company suites.\n5. **Demo:** `docker restart codx-junior-api`, run the new pytest file, then `/<company-slug>` \u2192 Settings \u2192 Company logo \u2192 Upload.\n\n**Delivered.** Run the Demo above. If something fails, reply with the failing step; I fix it in this turn.",
